flowchart LR
  S[Immutable source file] --> I[Import receipt and schema check]
  I --> Q[Quality profile]
  Q --> P[Prepared table with raw values preserved]
  P --> F[File-local analysis]
  F --> V[Validation and sensitivity checks]
  V --> R[Versioned aggregate result]
  R --> E[Evidence Passport and chart]
  E --> H[Human review and bounded action]
  X{Check failed?} -->|Yes| N[WARN / BLOCKED / NOT_RUN]
  I -. gate .-> X
  Q -. gate .-> X
  V -. gate .-> X
